{"id":"628916","name":"钵仔糕","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/628916/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"钵仔糕粉","amount":"300g"},{"name":"蜜红豆","amount":"适量"},{"name":"糖桂花","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"白砂糖","amount":"100g"},{"name":"清水","amount":"500g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备糖桂花和蜜红豆。","img":"images/628916/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"分别装在小钵中。","img":"images/628916/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"碗中倒入500g温水，加入100g白砂糖。","img":"images/628916/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"搅拌至完全融化。","img":"images/628916/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入糕粉(糕粉网上有售)。","img":"images/628916/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅拌至无颗粒。","img":"images/628916/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅中水开上气，把小钵放入锅内。","img":"images/628916/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"盛入糕浆，大火蒸15分钟，焖3分钟再开盖。","img":"images/628916/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"钵仔糕蒸好了，要彻底放凉才能脱膜。","img":"images/628916/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品。Q弹甜蜜，两种口味都非常好吃。","img":"images/628916/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}